---------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data sources
---------------------------------------------------------------------

This package's I/O layer encodes/decodes data derived from the
Intracardiac Atrial Fibrillation Database (IAFDB) from PhysioNet,
doi:10.13026/C23S33, distributed under the Open Data Commons
Attribution License v1.0 (ODC-By v1.0). See:
  https://physionet.org/content/iafdb/1.0.0/

The synthetic-bank format produced by sibling package
myocard-synthetic-egm-pipeline is derived (via simulation) from
Finitewave, a Python framework for cardiac electrophysiology
simulation, BSD-3-Clause licensed. See:
  https://github.com/TiNezlobinsky/Finitewave
